mods: swf-gate
timeout: 90s

# SWF gate (docs/swf-emitter-fix-spec.md §8): the only question is whether the game boots to the
# main menu with mods/swf-gate/swfs/gate.swf listed in swflist.gon.append. The failing case is a
# post-load null-deref during the _Append_AbilityIcon merge, which the harness reports as `crash`
# before any directive runs. Generate the variant first: `npm run test:swfgate -- <variant>`.
wait frames 120
cmd listcmds
expect console "Executed: listcmds"
quit
